1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,145
They were lost in the dark. All they needed was a helping hand.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,617
This is Lanternfolk: three short chapters, played seated, with nothing but your hands.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,946
Chapter one. A shy lantern spirit is asleep. One gentle touch wakes it.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,270
Hold out your palm, and it walks across your hand.

5
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:33,321
But keep it steady. Tip your hand, and it loses its balance, and floats back, a little dizzy.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,237
Try again, slowly, and it makes it home.

7
00:00:47,299 --> 00:00:48,937
Chapter two.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,906
A playful spirit climbs onto your palm. Lift it to the ledge, but mind the swinging branches.

9
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,237
Go up, and over, one ledge at a time.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,157
Each friend you bring home lights the grove, and the music grows warmer.

11
00:01:30,299 --> 00:01:31,915
Chapter three.

12
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:37,606
Two friends need a bridge.

13
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:52,620
Pinch the glowing leaf, and lay it across. The spirits you rescued watch, and cheer each one home.

14
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:06,812
Finally, scoop the star onto your open palm, and carry it, steadily, to the top of the great tree.

15
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:19,586
The grove wakes up. Every spirit gathers, and the first friend you helped comes to say thank you.

16
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:30,444
Lanternfolk. Your hands can become someone else's way home.
